      "description": "Verifies the `?fields=` sparse fieldset feature across all three live endpoints.\n\nRules under test:\n- Only the requested fields appear in each item.\n- `meta` is always returned in full regardless of `?fields=`.\n- Unknown field names are silently ignored (no 400 error).\n- Omitting `?fields=` returns all fields (backwards compatible).\n- `?fields=` and `skip`/`take` pagination can be combined freely."
    },
